    <description>DIR-1782: V7 base (delegates Opportunity stage transitions to RES_OpportunityStageUpdateValidation) plus a RES_Config_Switch__c gate and bundle-aware validation: a Quote may have only one root unit/bundle. ParentQuoteLineItemId is NOT yet populated on bundle component lines at insert time (the platform links them in a later step), so both the per-record root check and the root-count query also exclude lines whose PriceWaterfallIdentifier starts with "ref_" - the constraint engine's marker for a component line it derived, as opposed to the "QLI{n}_0__0"-style identifier on the line the user actually selected.</description>
